---
// Giving section
---

<section id="contact" class="px-6 lg:px-12 py-[120px] bg-gradient-to-br from-navy to-navy-dark text-white relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1532629345422-7515f3d16bb6?w=1920&q=80')] bg-center bg-cover opacity-8"></div>
  <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto relative z-10 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-20 items-center">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="inline-block text-gold-light text-[13px] font-semibold tracking-[2px] uppercase mb-4">Generosity</span>
      <h2 class="text-[clamp(36px,4vw,48px)] text-white mb-5">Return God's Tithes & Offerings</h2>
      <p class="text-white/80 text-[17px] leading-relaxed mb-4">Your faithful giving supports ministry, outreach, and the work of God's kingdom. Every gift makes a difference.</p>
      <div class="mt-8 p-5 lg:p-6 bg-white/6 border-l-3 border-gold rounded-r-xl">
        <p class="font-heading text-base italic text-white/90 leading-relaxed">
          "Each of you should give what you have decided in your heart to give, not reluctantly or under compulsion, for God loves a cheerful giver."
          <span class="block mt-2 text-gold text-[13px] font-semibold font-body not-italic">— 2 Corinthians 9:7</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid gap-4 reveal">
      {[
        { icon: '💳', title: 'Online Giving', desc: 'Secure card / mobile money via M-Pesa' },
        { icon: '🏦', title: 'Bank Transfer', desc: 'Direct deposit to church account' },
        { icon: '⛪', title: 'In-Person', desc: 'During Sabbath services or by appointment' },
        { icon: '📊', title: 'Annual Report', desc: 'View how your gifts are used in ministry' },
      ].map(g => (
        <a href="#" class="bg-white/6 border border-white/10 rounded-2xl p-6 flex items-center gap-5 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/10 hover:border-gold hover:translate-x-1 no-underline text-white">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-gradient-to-br from-gold to-gold-light rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shrink-0">{g.icon}</div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="text-lg text-white mb-1">{g.title}</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-white/60">{g.desc}</p>
          </div>
          <span class="ml-auto text-gold text-xl">→</span>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
